                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>To cover those needs we have at present in our warehouses about: 30,000</p>
                <p>Bought but not yet delivered (from France) 50,000 complete</p>
                <p>Part shall be furnished by the country. Aside from that we must receive from
